# Pyreon-emitted Kotlin lands inside the source tree but is gitignored —
# `scripts/build.sh` regenerates it on every Gradle build. Scoped to the
# emitted FILE (named after the shared `FinanceApp.tsx`) rather than the whole
# directory, matching native-counter-android: hand-written app code may need to
# share this package, since the emit references app classes unqualified.
